- `lib/common/book_webview_scroll_helper.dart` — JS + restore/cancel
- `lib/common/book_webview_state_store.dart` — persist
- `lib/common/book_tab_chrome.dart` — ẩn menu bottom khi immersive
- `lib/menu/chuyen_phap_luan_webview.dart` — tab Book + immersive
- `lib/menu/all_books_webview.dart` — All Books (enum đa ngôn ngữ)

